body:
I am turning Grok @Bot into a small team where each bot manages a repo, using Cursor Cloud Agent for coding. 

@duyetbot is the leader whom I just need to talk to, it knows how to delegate tasks or ask for information like a real life. They can also directly ping others when they need integration between projects. The QA bot keeps validating after they finish or hunts for bugs, etc. 

I tested it run continuously for 48 hours generating 400+ of github prs and burn all Grok Bot tokens, but I found the delivery to be very good so far, will find a way to optimize t hat later.
